# Metadata: the published snapshots ({id}.md, written by build_tables.R) and the prompts are tracked.
# Drafts and other working files (any name with an underscore, e.g. 3381_draft.md) and other
# subfolders stay local.
Metadata/*
!Metadata/Prompts/
!Metadata/[0-9]*.md
Metadata/*_*.md

# Docs: working documents (Word, Excel, PowerPoint, rendered HTML, subfolders) stay local. New
# Markdown guides and images are still picked up, and files already in git stay tracked.
Docs/*
!Docs/*.md
!Docs/*.png
